          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>Priority</a:Key>
            <a:Value>High</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>StateInformation</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Design review only; no runtime mitigation is claimed. See docs/security/threat-model.md#tmt-analysis-and-disposition. Keep request state and fallback classification explicit; untrusted results cannot redirect policy or resume terminated work. Rely on runtime/OS memory protections within the workstation threat model. V2-REQ-015, V2-REQ-023, V2-REQ-025.</a:Value>
