        <a:Category>D</a:Category>
        <a:Description>Does {source.Name} or {target.Name} take explicit steps to control resource consumption? Resource consumption attacks can be hard to deal with, and there are times that it makes sense to let the OS do the job. Be careful that your resource requests don't deadlock, and that they do timeout.</a:Description>
